  "details": "What I've recognized in this game is that there's a massive problem into keeping track of users who claims that they've been in the game for a long time (As it is impossible to tell), and the hash ID's being messy as Hell when trying to find an account, In one game I play, one of my ID's is 56463437 (August 28th, 2010, example images shown), and in VRChat it looks like I smashed my keyboard while trying to find the link for my profile to be shown. (usr_3024def3-16e8-4284-9345-f49c8b421572)\n\nSo I have a suggestion to have it cleaned up.\n\nWhat I suggest for the game to do is add in the exact number of accounts created and add in one numerical for the next account created along with a mandatory account creation date shown on the user's profile.\n\n(Included groups with date creations too.)\n\nPros: Organization of links, OG bragging rights.\n\nCons: Old links may become useless.",
